# Local setup

Copy to `AGENTS.local.md` (gitignored). Use this file for per-machine paths only.

## Checkouts

| Repo (host/org/repo) | Path |
|---|---|
| code.example.org/example/service | ~/dev/example/service |

## Local documents

Rows in project `DOCS.md` files with `Agent access: local` resolve here. Read them in place; never copy or publish them.

| Doc (as named in DOCS.md) | Path |
|---|---|
| Service design | ~/Documents/service-design.md |

